(text "DESIGN CALCULATIONS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 110.00 140.00 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "03b04bb1-f216-4e8f-afff-0ca71b7e0869"))
(text "ZMCT103C: 5 A : 5 mA (1000:1), 4500 V isolation, linear 0-15 A,\n  accuracy 0.2 % / phase <= 15' specified at a 50 ohm burden -> 49.9 ohm 0.1 %.\nSignal V = I/1000 x 49.9 ohm: 1 A -> 50 mV rms, clips (+-1.6 V) at 22.7 A rms.\nBurden power at 15 A: (15 mA)^2 x 49.9 = 11 mW (1206 = 250 mW).\nSMAJ5.0CA: conducts from 6.4 V = 128 mA secondary = 91 A primary (fault only).\nSecondary is never open: burden sits at the CT pins, cable unplugged is safe.\nHole dia 5 mm: one single conductor (L) with a thin extra sleeve, OD < 5 mm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 110.00 145.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8f5b2650-4566-4f49-8f6b-d245fdc29e5e"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
